  Dialogue:
  - Time: 0
    Dialogue:
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"]Hi! Welcome to Prefora! Here we''ll be teaching you the
        basics'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f85c7c1de9e3ed4ab63d0578f359171, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"]In this game, you''ll follow the prompts of your opponent
        to defeat them by matching the rhythm'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a195944cf68a070478b5f7eeaa86301f, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"]Gloria will perform a sequence of moves, and then you''ll
        try to repeat it back to her, so that you can dodge her attacks '
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 502b2bbce0aba624583c2649d06a5598, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"]First, let''s start with just one note. When Gloria moves
        on the beat, you move on the next beat. For now, she''ll just go up'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7430197a7e3b950409d9c77b0e65b131, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][tutorial="Hit(5)"][patterns="1"]Okay, now you give it
        a try!'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de2074533e824d94b83fccf17f04d691, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"]Great job! '
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6cbc715e49e9a2e4b969b825666b0c9c, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][tutorial="Hit(5)"][patterns="1,2,3,4"]Now, let''s try
        different directions'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c22b31e95f5d158478a85cab557f5dfd, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"]Now you''re getting it! '
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4079ef26f8587e4b911f5910d789ecb, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][tutorial="Sequence(3)"][patterns="5,6"]Let''s try to
        get all four directions in, can you get all the patterns?'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d9290c3c12cae44f9cd4664daf6f723, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"]Fantastic! If you miss a note, you''ll fail
        that sequence and lose your own health'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d58bca9210b160428e2ab64d5adcc05, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s=tutorial]Now, try and beat a few harder sequences here to prove you''ve
        got what it takes to take on Gloria'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4f10de4c3c1b29409fffff714bf1611, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][tutorial="Sequence(3)"][patterns="7,8,9"]Good luck!!'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 066a2b7abf2e4654687ae9d0cec4d641, type: 3}
